From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ad5xrecon <ad5xrecon@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 22:30:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] discovery: Moonraker's warnings on the screen

HelixScreen never reads Moonraker's warnings (server.info "warnings").
Fluidd shows them, the touch screen didn't, so a printer that fell back
to another kernel (Kiln's kiln_os component: the opt-in 7.3 kernel
failed to start, or Kiln's kernel did and the stock one runs) said so
only in a browser.

On HELIX_KILN_AD5X builds each warning becomes a warning toast that
stays until it is closed ("Printer warning" over the text) and a row
under the home screen's bell. Discovery runs again on every
klippy_ready and reconnect, so each text is shown once per run of the
app; after a restart it shows again while Moonraker still has it.
---
 src/api/moonraker_discovery_sequence.cpp | 27 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 translations/en.yml                      |  2 ++
 translations/ru.yml                      |  1 +
 3 files changed, 30 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/api/moonraker_discovery_sequence.cpp b/src/api/moonraker_discovery_sequence.cpp
index 6e4f450780..9fcc7f5d6c 100644
--- a/src/api/moonraker_discovery_sequence.cpp
+++ b/src/api/moonraker_discovery_sequence.cpp
@@ -3,6 +3,8 @@
 
 #include "moonraker_discovery_sequence.h"
 
+#include "lvgl/src/others/translation/lv_translation.h"
+#include "ui_notification.h"
 #include "accel_sensor_manager.h"
 #include "ams_backend.h"
 #include "ams_state.h"
@@ -65,6 +67,8 @@
 
 #include <algorithm>
 #include <cctype>
+#include <mutex>
+#include <set>
 #include <thread>
 #include <unordered_set>
 #include <utility>
@@ -716,6 +720,29 @@ void MoonrakerDiscoverySequence::on_server_info(uint64_t seq, const json& info_r
     if (is_stale() || !is_current_sequence(seq))
         return;
     if (const json* result = helix::json_util::find_member(info_response, "result")) {
+#if defined(HELIX_KILN_AD5X)
+        // Kiln OS: Moonraker's warnings (server.info "warnings", the ones Fluidd
+        // shows, e.g. kiln_os's "the printer fell back to another kernel") as a
+        // warning toast that stays until it is closed, and a row under the bell.
+        // Discovery runs again on every klippy_ready and reconnect: each text
+        // once per run.
+        if (auto w = result->find("warnings"); w != result->end() && w->is_array()) {
+            static std::mutex shown_mutex;
+            static std::set<std::string> shown;
+            for (const auto& item : *w) {
+                if (!item.is_string())
+                    continue;
+                std::string text = item.get<std::string>();
+                {
+                    std::lock_guard<std::mutex> lock(shown_mutex);
+                    if (text.empty() || !shown.insert(text).second)
+                        continue;
+                }
+                spdlog::warn("[Moonraker Client] Moonraker warning: {}", text);
+                ui_notification_warning_sticky(lv_tr("Printer warning"), text.c_str());
+            }
+        }
+#endif
         apply_server_info(seq, *result);
     }
 
diff --git a/translations/en.yml b/translations/en.yml
index 54fbbafa82..4ea3dcf0bf 100644
--- a/translations/en.yml
+++ b/translations/en.yml
@@ -6472,6 +6472,8 @@ translations:
   NOT AVAILABLE HERE: "NOT AVAILABLE HERE"
   The plugin didn't say why.: "The plugin didn't say why."
   # Kiln OS (AD5X) strings from the Kiln HelixScreen patches
+  # Moonraker's warnings on the screen (patch 0059)
+  'Printer warning': 'Printer warning'
   # Kiln's tour (patch 0058, tour_steps_kiln.cpp)
   'Welcome to Kiln OS': 'Welcome to Kiln OS'
   'Here''s a quick tour of the screen, so you can find things fast.': 'Here''s a quick tour of the screen, so you can find things fast.'
diff --git a/translations/ru.yml b/translations/ru.yml
index b122c8bb12..94a22f6b4b 100644
--- a/translations/ru.yml
+++ b/translations/ru.yml
@@ -6643,6 +6643,7 @@ translations:
   'Load and Unload are here. Settings has Auto-Refill, Tune IFS and Pre-feed.': 'Здесь «Загрузить» и «Выгрузить». В разделе «Настройки» — «Автозамена», «Настроить IFS» и «Предзагрузка».'
   'Macros, G-code console, print history, Spoolman, calibration, and Shutdown or Reboot.': 'Макросы, консоль G-code, история печати, Spoolman, калибровка, выключение и перезагрузка.'
   'Screen, sound, connection, and the printer''s own settings: Run Setup Wizard, Nozzle Size, Filament Auto-Refill, Plugins. Replay this tour from Help & About.': 'Экран, звук, соединение и настройки принтера: «Запустить мастер настройки», «Размер сопла», «Автозамена филамента», «Плагины». Повторить тур: «Помощь и о программе».'
+  'Printer warning': 'Предупреждение принтера'
   'More': 'Ещё'
   Price per kWh: "Цена за кВт·ч"
   'Price, location, lot, notes': 'Цена, место, партия, заметки'
